# Direct runtime dependencies of the Databricks App.
#
# requirements.txt is COMPILED from this against Python 3.11 — the Apps runtime
# version, which differs from the 3.12 this project develops on:
#
#   uv pip compile app-requirements.in --python-version 3.11 --no-header \
#     -o requirements.txt
#
# Kept as a separate input rather than exported from uv.lock because the lock
# pins requires-python ==3.12.* and produces wheels the App cannot install.
